WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.700
Start and controls
Take a seat and press Ready. The host starts when everyone is ready. Your cards or dice are at the bottom.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:19.000
Follow the turn prompt. Wait for animations to finish; an expired turn is played automatically. Use Return to room after settlement.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Spades | North-South against East-West
Four players receive thirteen cards each. Spades are always trump and opposite seats are partners. Compare team match totals.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:48.200
Select a bid and confirm
Starting left of the dealer, bid zero to thirteen in order. Add the partners’ ordinary bids for the team contract.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:59.000
Zero is Nil: take no tricks for +100, or lose 100 if any trick is taken. Blind Nil is not used.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:19.000
Play in order and follow suit
The player left of the dealer leads. Click a legal card, or select and confirm on phones. The trick winner leads next.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:30.000
When void, discard or trump
The highest spade wins; without spades, the highest card of the led suit wins. Always follow suit if possible.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:39.000
Spades must be broken before leading them unless only spades remain. There are no other first-trick discard restrictions.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:52.200
Rule note | Contracts, Nil and bags
Making the contract earns ten per bid trick; failing loses ten per bid trick. Every overtrick adds one point and one bag.

00:01:52.200 --> 00:02:03.000
Failed-Nil tricks cannot fulfill the partner’s contract, but each adds one point and one bag. Every ten bags cost 100 points; carry the remainder.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:35.000
Finish the first full hand
Accelerate through thirteen tricks, then compare bids, tricks, Nil, bags and points. Rotate the dealer for the next hand.

00:02:35.000 --> 00:03:35.000
Accelerate until the match is decided
Bid and finish every remaining hand while carrying scores and bags. Reaching the target is checked only after a completed hand.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:44.900
Spades | Reach five hundred
When a team reaches 500, the higher total wins for both partners. Equal totals require another hand.

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:53.000
Both partners receive a win. Return to the room to start a new match.
